                                    Human Resource Management
                                </span>
                                <h4 class="it-section-title mb-20">Do you want to pursue a career in Human Resource
                                    Management ?</h4>
                            </div>
                            <div class="it-course-intro-text">
                                <p class="mb-25 fs-5">Dream of leading talent acquisition and fostering workplace
                                    excellence? From recruitment and employee development to organisational strategy and
                                    compliance � our Diploma in Human Resource Management can set you on the path to
                                    success.</p>
                                <p class="mb-25">Accredited and recognised by leading HR organisations, our online Human
                                    Resource Management online course covers everything from talent management, employee
                                    relations, and performance appraisal to organisational strategy, legal compliance,
                                    and workplace diversity.</p>
                                <p class="mb-25">Our Level 4 and 5 diploma in Human Resource Management is equivalent to
                                    the first two years of an undergraduate course, allowing learners to progress onto
                                    the final year of an undergraduate degree program at a university.</p>
                                <p class="mb-30">This course is eligible for ELCAS funding.</p>
