                                <!-- How it works -->
                                <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="how-it-works" role="tabpanel"
                                    aria-labelledby="how-it-works-tab">
                                    <div class="it-course-info-content-box">
                                        <h3 class="it-course-info-title mb-25">How this HR Online Course Works</h3>
                                        <div class="it-course-info-text">
                                            <p class="mb-20">
                                                Students on our Human Resource Management online course can complete a
                                                Level 4 (120 credits) Diploma, Level 5 (120 credits) or a combined Level
                                                4 & 5 (240 credits) diploma, designed to provide students with the
                                                skills needed to succeed in the Human Resource Management industry.
                                            </p>

                                            <p class="mb-20">
                                                This Human Resources qualification is completed online and you can start
                                                at any time, it's completely flexible. Each module of our HR management
                                                course (Level 4 & Level 5) consists of <strong>40 hours of guided online
                                                    learning</strong>, with an additional <strong>30-50 hours</strong>
                                                worth of optional materials that include recommended exercises,
                                                readings, digital resources and self-test tasks.
                                            </p>

                                            <p class="mb-20">
                                                To complete this Human Resources course you'll submit <strong>10 online
                                                    assignments</strong> at Level 4, and <strong>6 online
                                                    assignments</strong> at Level 5. Assignments are approximately
                                                <strong>2,000-3,000 words</strong> each. Once you've passed your course,
                                                you'll be awarded with a Level 4 and Level 5 diploma in Human Resource
                                                management, and you'll be able to top up your Human Resources
                                                qualification to a bachelor's degree at a range of UK universities.
                                            </p>

                                            <p class="mb-30">
                                                During this Diploma in Human Resource Management online course you'll
                                                have access to <strong>1-2-1 tutor support</strong> and webinars, social
                                                learning forums and additional materials to complete your diploma in HRM
                                                with ease. You can find out more about the support you'll have available
                                                on our Student Resources page. You can also read about the academic
                                                credentials we meet and associations we're part of to make sure you have
                                                the best learning experience.
                                            </p>

